          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n<meta charset='utf-8'>\\n<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n<title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n<style>\\n:root{\\n  --bg1:#e6fffb;\\n  --bg2:#eef2ff;\\n  --accent:#0f766e;\\n  --accent2:#7c3aed;\\n  --muted:#6b7280;\\n  --card:#ffffff;\\n  --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n}\\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\\nbody{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;font-size:16px;color:var(--accent);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\\n.site-header{position:relative;padding:32px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n.logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(124,58,237,0.16)}\\n.nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n.nav a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}\\n.nav a.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent2),var(--accent));color:white;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(15,118,110,0.12)}\\n.hero{position:relative;padding:36px 20px;margin:10px auto;max-width:1100px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:24px;align-items:start}\\n.hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),var(--glass));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-radius:18px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)}\\n.hero h1{margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:28px;color:var(--accent2)}\\n.hero p.lead{margin:0 0 16px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}\\n.contact-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n.contact-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)}\\n.info-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n.icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}\\n.form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\ninput,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;font-size:15px}\\ntextarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n.btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent2),var(--accent));color:white;border:none;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\\n.small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n.footer{margin-top:auto;padding:28px 20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(124,58,237,0.06),transparent);display:flex;justify-content:center}\\n.pattern-svg{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.14}\\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n@media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<!-- decorative svg pattern -->\\n<svg class='pattern-svg' viewBox='0 0 800 600' preserveAspectRatio='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\\n  <defs>\\n    <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>\\n      <stop offset='0' stop-color='#7c3aed'/>\\n      <stop offset='1' stop-color='#0f766e'/>\\n    </linearGradient>\\n    <pattern id='p' width='40' height='40' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse' patternTransform='rotate(15)'>\\n      <rect width='40' height='40' fill='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'/>\\n      <path d='M0 20 L40 20' stroke='url(#g1)' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-opacity='0.12'/>\\n      <circle cx='8' cy='8' r='1.6' fill='url(#g1)' opacity='0.12'/>\\n    </pattern>\\n  </defs>\\n  <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#p)'/>\\n</svg>\\n\\n<header class='site-header'>\\n  <div class='brand'>\\n    <div class='logo' aria-hidden='true'>HM</div>\\n    <div>\\n      <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div class='small'>Integrative care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <nav class='nav' aria-label='primary'>\\n    <a href='/' aria-current='page'>Home</a>\\n    <a href='/approach.html'>How we work</a>\\n    <a href='/services.html'>Services</a>\\n    <a class='cta' href='/book.html'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n  </nav>\\n</header>\\n\\n<main role='main'>\\n  <section class='hero' aria-labelledby='contact-heading'>\\n    <div class='hero-card'>\\n      <h1 id='contact-heading'>Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n      <p class='lead'>Practical, whole-person care that blends evidence-informed therapies and personalized lifestyle planning. We offer in-person and telehealth appointments—education and partnership, not promises.</p>\\n\\n      <div class='contact-panel'>\\n        <div class='contact-card'>\\n          <div class='info-row'>\\n            <div class='icon'>P</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style='font-weight:700'>Phone</div>\\n              <div class='small'><a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='contact-card'>\\n          <div class='info-row'>\\n            <div class='icon'>E</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style='font-weight:700'>Email</div>\\n              <div class='small'><a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='contact-card'>\\n          <div style='font-weight:700'>Office</div>\\n          <div class='small'>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — office visits by appointment. Telehealth available in licensed regions.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <aside class='contact-card' aria-label='contact form'>\\n      <div style='font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px'>Send a message & book</div>\\n      <form class='form' id='contactForm' method='post' action='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>\\n        <label class='small'>Full name<input name='name' type='text' required placeholder='Your name'></label>\\n        <label class='small'>Email<input name='email' type='email' required placeholder='you@domain.com'></label>\\n        <label class='small'>Phone (optional)<input name='phone' type='tel' placeholder='(555) 555-5555'></label>\\n        <label class='small'>Preferred visit type\\n          <select name='visit'>\\n            <option>Telehealth</option><option>In-person</option><option>Either</option>\\n          </select>\\n        </label>\\n        <label class='small'>Reason for consult<textarea name='message' placeholder='Briefly describe concerns or goals'></textarea></label>\\n        <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between'>\\n          <button class='btn' type='submit'>Request an appointment</button>\\n          <div class='small' style='max-width:220px'>We respond within 2 business days. This is not an emergency line—if urgent, call local emergency services.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='small' style='margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)'>By contacting us you consent to receive communications. No medical guarantees; complementary and integrative approaches are educational and supportive.</div>\\n      </form>\\n    </aside>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section style='max-width:1100px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 20px;display:grid;gap:14px'>\\n    <div class='grid'>\\n      <div class='contact-card'>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>Meet your practitioner</div>\\n        <div class='small' style='margin-top:6px'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — A collaborative clinician who blends clinical training with lifestyle medicine, nutrition awareness, and mind-body tools. We focus on long-term resilience rather than quick fixes.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class='contact-card'>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>Hours & availability</div>\\n        <div class='small' style='margin-top:6px'>Mon–Thu: 9:00am–5:00pm<br>Fri: 9:00am–2:00pm<br>Weekends by request (limited)</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class='contact-card'>\\n      <div style='font-weight:700'>Location & map</div>\\n      <div class='small' style='margin-top:6px'>Our office is in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Exact address provided after appointment booking. For privacy and security we do not display the address publicly.</div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class='contact-card'>\\n      <div style='font-weight:700'>Payment & insurance</div>\\n      <div class='small' style='margin-top:6px'>We offer a hybrid model: fee-for-service and membership options. Insurance reimbursement varies—we provide superbills on request. Ask during initial intake for details.</div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class='contact-card'>\\n      <div style='font-weight:700'>Privacy & communication</div>\\n      <div class='small' style='margin-top:6px'>Messages are confidential. We use secure telehealth platforms for virtual visits. For sensitive health communication, we recommend scheduling rather than email.</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n</main>\\n\\n<footer class='footer'>\\n  <div style='max-width:1100px;width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 20px'>\\n    <div>\\n      <div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div class='small'>A collaborative, evidence-informed approach to whole person health.</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>\\n      <a class='small' href='/about.html'>About</a>\\n      <a class='small' href='/services.html'>What we treat</a>\\n      <a class='small' href='/book.html'>Book</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<script>\\ndocument.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit',function(e){\\n  // simple UX guard\\n  var name=this.name.value.trim();\\n  var email=this.email.value.trim();\\n  if(!name || !email){e.preventDefault();alert('Please provide name and email.');}\\n});\\n</script>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Project: Holistic / Integrative Medicine site (layout: bold_playful, tone: clinical_calm)\\n\\nThis chunk contains two files for the build:\\n- contact.html — contact and booking page, responsive, accessible, and styled with CSS + inline SVG pattern for decorative background.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace in templates (keep the double-braced tokens):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n\\nNotes & guidance:\\n- The site voice is clinical and calm: focus on education, whole-person care, and realistic outcomes. Avoid claiming cures or guarantees.\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}; hook this to your booking endpoint or form processor. Basic client-side validation is included. Ensure server-side validation as well.\\n- Hybrid offer model: language in the contact page references in-person and telehealth. Membership and fee-for-service options are mentioned in non-committal terms.\\n- Accessibility: form fields include labels, required attributes, and clear call-to-action. Ensure color contrast meets your WCAG targets when replacing brand colors.\\n\\nSVG and assets:\\n- For visual richness the header/footer include an inline SVG pattern. If you prefer to centralize assets, extract the <svg> block from contact.html and save as assets/img/pattern.svg, then reference it as a background image in CSS.\\n\\nPrivacy & clinical disclaimers:\\n- The contact page includes copy reminding users this is not an emergency line and that integrative approaches are educational/supportive. Keep similar tone across other pages.\\n\\nDevelopment tips:\\n- Nav labels are intentionally varied to keep templates distinct across the site: \\\"How we work\\\" vs \\\"Approach\\\" vs \\\"What we treat\\\" on other pages.\\n- Copy in other pages should include the required sections (hero, story, framework, offers, pricing, testimonials, cta) and respect the holistic medicine rules (no guaranteed cures, list conditions with disclaimers where appropriate).\\n\\nDeployment:\\n- This is a static HTML fragment ready to drop into a site. Replace placeholders, add any server handlers for the form action, and include analytics or privacy tooling as required by your organization.\\n\\nIf you need complementary files (SVG extracted to assets, alternate color schemes, or a JS form handler), request the next chunk and specify which assets to include.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
